description: Require Rust nightly and avoid release builds during development
alwaysApply: true
---

# Rust Development Commands

- We use rust nightly only
- Never run a release-profile command during development unless the developer explicitly asks for it.
- This prohibition includes `cargo build --release`, `cargo test --release`, `cargo run --release`, and commands using `--profile release`.
- Use the default development or test profile for normal verification.
